{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cIs this a Game yet?\u201d is an open invitation: you and me, building a game live, one update at a time. In the beginning you\u2019ll find exactly one button and a global leaderboard\u2014no tutorials, no roadmaps. Every click, every idea, every vote shapes what comes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HOW IT WORKS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Blank Canvas Start</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One button, one counter, zero instructions. Your clicks fill an empty leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Player-Driven Updates</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of each cycle, the top 3 global scorers and top 2 most liked submissions will be chosen and implemented in the very next update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Live Co-Development</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The entire development happens live on stream. Jump into chat, suggest features on the fly, watch your ideas take shape in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Endless Possibilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Today it\u2019s a clicker; tomorrow it could be a platformer, puzzle, RPG\u2014or something we\u2019ve never seen before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WHY JUMP IN NOW?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 You\u2019re not just playing\u2014you\u2019re designing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Real-time feedback via livestream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Rapid-fire updates mean the game never feels the same twice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Join a tight-knit community where every vote matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EARLY ACCESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click, climb, design\u2014let's find out together if we can turn the answer to &quot;Is this a Game yet?&quot; from a No into a Yes.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3831220?t=1751496500","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/30f6daf9d1860a2820c6f0768e288c8ec7b509b4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751496500","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/12b4efe98422f91c0ac4c93f3c0894f817b92ffe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751496500","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/12b4efe98422f91c0ac4c93f3c0894f817b92ffe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751496500","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cIs this a Game yet?\u201d is an open invitation: you and me, building a game live, one update at a time. In the beginning you\u2019ll find exactly one button and a global leaderboard\u2014no tutorials, no roadmaps. Every click, every idea, every vote shapes what comes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HOW IT WORKS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Blank Canvas Start</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One button, one counter, zero instructions. Your clicks fill an empty leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Player-Driven Updates</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of each cycle, the top 3 global scorers and top 2 most liked submissions will be chosen and implemented in the very next update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Live Co-Development</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The entire development happens live on stream. Jump into chat, suggest features on the fly, watch your ideas take shape in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Endless Possi